  "note": "Two measured causes with one symptom. The engine resolves an upstream reference by walking COLUMNS, so an element whose column lists are empty gets a reference to nothing (ENG-021); and when the walk fails the renderer emits a not-found placeholder that reaches the artifact as a dangling reference (ENG-022). A column-poor platform hits both.",
